{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"type":"text","text":" module provides low-level cryptographic services for sensitive card operations. Unlike "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CardSessions"},{"type":"text","text":" (which handles networking, session management, and token handling automatically), the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"text":" module is a pure crypto library: you manage all network calls yourself and use the SDK only for encryption and decryption.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"type":"text","text":" module when you need:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Full control over the network layer (custom networking stack, interceptors, retry logic)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Integration into an architecture that doesn’t use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"async\/await"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Direct access to the encrypted keys and data for custom backend flows"}]}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"tip","name":"Tip","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you prefer a higher-level API that handles networking and token management, use "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardSessionsGuide"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}]}]},{"text":"Import","anchor":"Import","type":"heading","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Card"]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"text":" module is a standalone cryptographic library that can be used without the rest of the SDK.","type":"text"}]}]},{"text":"Session Token Roles","anchor":"Session-Token-Roles","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend needs the following API credential roles to call the Adyen endpoints used in these flows:","type":"text"}]},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Operation","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Role"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card reveal"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bank Issuing PaymentInstrument Reveal Webservice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"PIN reveal","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Bank Issuing Pin Reveal Webservice","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"PIN change","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bank Issuing Pin Change Webservice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table"},{"level":2,"text":"Card Reveal","anchor":"Card-Reveal","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reveal the card’s PAN, CVC, and expiry date.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Flow","anchor":"Flow","level":3},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend fetches a public key from Adyen ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GET \/publicKey?purpose=panReveal&format=jwk"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass the public key to the SDK to generate an encrypted session key","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend sends the encrypted key to Adyen (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/paymentInstruments\/reveal"},{"text":") and receives encrypted card data","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass the encrypted data to the SDK to decrypt and obtain the card details","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"heading","text":"Implementation","anchor":"Implementation","level":3},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Card","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the service","let cardRevealService = CardRevealService()","","\/\/ 2. Generate an encrypted key using the public key from your backend.","\/\/    The public key is the raw JWK data from the Adyen \/publicKey endpoint.","\/\/    The service retains the generated symmetric key for the decryption step.","let encryptedKey = try cardRevealService.generateEncryptedKey(","    jwk: publicKeyData",")","","\/\/ 3. Send `encryptedKey` to your backend.","\/\/    Your backend calls POST \/paymentInstruments\/reveal with:","\/\/    {","\/\/        \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"PI123...\",","\/\/        \"encryptedKey\": encryptedKey","\/\/    }","\/\/    and returns the `encryptedData` string from the response.","","\/\/ 4. Decrypt the card details using the same service instance","let details = try cardRevealService.cardDetails(","    encryptedData: encryptedData",")","","\/\/ Access the decrypted values","details.pan            \/\/ Full PAN, e.g. \"5412345678901234\"","details.cvc            \/\/ CVC, e.g. \"123\"","details.expiration.month  \/\/ e.g. \"03\"","details.expiration.year   \/\/ e.g. \"2028\""]},{"name":"Important","type":"aside","style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cardDetails"},{"text":" on the same ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CardRevealService"},{"text":" instance that produced the encrypted key. The instance retains the symmetric key generated by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey"},{"text":"; calling ","type":"text"},{"code":"cardDetails","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before generating a key throws ","type":"text"},{"code":".keyNotGenerated","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you have a PEM\/DER-encoded public key instead of JWK, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey(pem:)"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let encryptedKey = try cardRevealService.generateEncryptedKey(","    pem: derEncodedPublicKey",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Error Handling","anchor":"Error-Handling","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"generateEncryptedKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"cardDetails","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" throw ","type":"text"},{"code":"CardRevealService.CardRevealError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Error","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cause"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".invalidPublicKey","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The public key could not be parsed","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".encryptionFailed","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key encryption failed"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".keyNotGenerated","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"cardDetails","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" was called before ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidEncryptedData"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The encrypted data string is not valid hex","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".decryptionFailed"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"AES decryption of the card data failed","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unexpectedData"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Decryption succeeded but the payload could not be decoded","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"text":"PIN Reveal","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"PIN-Reveal"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Retrieve the card’s current PIN.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Flow","anchor":"Flow","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend fetches a public key from Adyen ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GET \/publicKey?purpose=pinReveal&format=jwk"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass the public key to the SDK to generate an encrypted session key","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend sends the encrypted key to Adyen (","type":"text"},{"code":"POST \/pins\/reveal","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") and receives an encrypted PIN block and token","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass both to the SDK to decrypt and obtain the PIN","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"text":"Implementation","anchor":"Implementation","type":"heading","level":3},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Card","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the service","let pinRevealService = PinRevealService()","","\/\/ 2. Generate an encrypted key.","\/\/    The service retains the generated symmetric key for the decryption step.","let encryptedKey = try pinRevealService.generateEncryptedKey(","    jwk: publicKeyData",")","","\/\/ 3. Send `encryptedKey` to your backend.","\/\/    Your backend calls POST \/pins\/reveal with:","\/\/    {","\/\/        \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"PI123...\",","\/\/        \"encryptedKey\": encryptedKey","\/\/    }","\/\/    and returns `encryptedPinBlock` and `token` from the response.","","\/\/ 4. Decrypt the PIN using the same service instance","let pin = try pinRevealService.pin(","    encryptedPinBlock: encryptedPinBlock,","    token: token",")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Error Handling","anchor":"Error-Handling","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pin"},{"text":" throw ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PinRevealService.PinRevealError"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Error"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Cause","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidPublicKey"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The public key could not be parsed"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".encryptionFailed","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Key encryption failed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".keyNotGenerated","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"pin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" was called before ","type":"text"},{"code":"generateEncryptedKey","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".invalidEncryptedData","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The encrypted PIN block is not valid","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".decryptionFailed"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Decryption failed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unexpectedData"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Decrypted PIN block has an unexpected format","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"level":2,"text":"PIN Change","anchor":"PIN-Change","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Set a new PIN for the card.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Flow","anchor":"Flow","type":"heading"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend fetches a public key from Adyen (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GET \/publicKey?purpose=pinChange&format=jwk"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass the public key and the new PIN to the SDK to generate the encrypted payload","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend sends the payload to Adyen (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/pins\/change"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Implementation","anchor":"Implementation"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Card","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the service","let pinChangeService = PinChangeService()","","\/\/ 2. Generate the encrypted PIN block","let encryptedPin = try pinChangeService.encryptedPinBlock(","    jwk: publicKeyData,","    pin: newPin",")","","\/\/ 3. Send to your backend.","\/\/    Your backend calls POST \/pins\/change with:","\/\/    {","\/\/        \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"PI123...\",","\/\/        \"encryptedKey\": encryptedPin.encryptedKey,","\/\/        \"encryptedPinBlock\": encryptedPin.encryptedPinBlock,","\/\/        \"token\": encryptedPin.token","\/\/    }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you have a PEM\/DER-encoded public key:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let encryptedPin = try pinChangeService.encryptedPinBlock(","    pem: derEncodedPublicKey,","    pin: newPin",")"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Error Handling","anchor":"Error-Handling"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"encryptedPinBlock","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" throws ","type":"text"},{"code":"PinChangeService.PinChangeError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Error","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Cause","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidPin"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The PIN is malformed (non-decimal characters, too long)","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unallowedPin"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The PIN is not permitted (sequential like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1234"},{"text":", repeated like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1111"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidPublicKey"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The public key could not be parsed","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".encryptionFailed","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"PIN encryption failed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Security Considerations","anchor":"Security-Considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"text":" module performs all cryptographic operations in memory. No sensitive data is written to disk.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The symmetric key generated during a reveal flow is ephemeral, held only for the lifetime of the service instance, and is never persisted or transmitted.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Display sensitive data (PAN, PIN) only temporarily and clear it from the UI promptly.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Never log or persist decrypted card details or PINs.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use a fresh ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CardRevealService"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PinRevealService"},{"type":"text","text":" instance per reveal operation, and generate a new encrypted key for each flow."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Migration from adyen-card-reveal-ios","anchor":"Migration-from-adyen-card-reveal-ios"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you previously used the standalone ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-card-reveal-ios","isActive":true},{"text":" package, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"text":" module is a drop-in replacement. The public API is unchanged; only the import name differs:","type":"text"}]},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Old API","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"New API","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import AdyenCardReveal"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Card"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey(jwk:)"},{"type":"text","text":" → "},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"unchanged","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"cardDetails(encryptedData:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"unchanged","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"pin(encryptedPinBlock:, token:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"unchanged","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"encryptedPinBlock(pem:, pin:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"unchanged","type":"t